{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Forty years I am disgusted</b> — like ונקוטותם, נקטה נפשי בחיי. Like געלה, for we find no prophecy to Moses within the forty." "<b>And the meaning of \"they did not know My ways\"</b> — as Moses said: ולא נתן HaShem לכם לב לדעת."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 95, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:37:21.567041710Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}